description:
What Youll Do
Contribute to a projects overall test strategy and test plan;
Create test scenarios; select the best methods, techniques and evaluation criteria for testing;
Build automation scripts and help the leads in the designing/configuring the test automation frameworks;
Execute the test cases using automation techniques;
Clearly report and help prioritize issues found during testing;

